PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786184293
OL,3,CWhat is false autumn? Why a cooler,
OL,4,Cwetter spell doesn't signal summer's
OL,5,Cend
OL,7,FAfter weeks of hot sunshine and
OL,8,Fexceptionally dry conditions across
OL,9,Fmuch of the UK, a spell of cooler,
OL,10,Fwetter weather can suddenly make it
OL,11,Ffeel as though autumn has arrived.
OL,13,FFresher mornings and evenings and the
OL,14,Freturn of Atlantic weather systems
OL,15,Foften lead people to wonder whether
OL,16,Fsummer has come to an early end.
OL,18,FSome areas of the north and west will
OL,19,Fsee much-needed rain in the coming
OL,20,Fdays, and temperatures will dip a few
OL,21,Fdegrees for a time.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
