PN,30902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786184293
OL,3,CWhat is false autumn? Why a cooler,
OL,4,Cwetter spell doesn't signal summer's
OL,5,Cend
OL,7,FIn reality, this is often referred to
OL,8,Fas "false autumn" ` a temporary
OL,9,Finterruption to summer rather than the
OL,10,Fstart of the new season. After a
OL,11,Fprolonged heatwave, even average
OL,12,Ftemperatures can feel cool because of
OL,13,Fthe contrast.
OL,15,FWith it still being early August,
OL,16,Fthere is plenty of time for summer to
OL,17,Freturn. The UK has seen some
OL,18,Fremarkable late-season warm spells in
OL,19,Fthe past, proving that autumn doesn't
OL,20,Falways arrive when expected.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
